:\"本文目錄\"}],[\"$\",\"ol\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_tocList__Rq_Lz\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"sec-1\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#sec-1\",\"children\":\"一、大盤表現總覽\"}]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"sec-2\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#sec-2\",\"children\":\"二、族群表現概況\"}]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"sec-3\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#sec-3\",\"children\":\"三、個股漲跌與市場焦點\"}]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"sec-4\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#sec-4\",\"children\":\"四、法人動向與籌碼面\"}]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"sec-5\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#sec-5\",\"children\":\"五、國際盤與相關消息\"}]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"sec-6\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#sec-6\",\"children\":\"常見問題 FAQ\"}]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"sec-7\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#sec-7\",\"children\":\"總結\"}]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"sec-8\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#sec-8\",\"children\":\"延伸閱讀\"}]}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_body__6B7Mb\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_intro__ATV5c\",\"children\":\"2026年8月28日台股加權指數上漲0.77%，收在46331.45點，櫃買指數也同步上揚0.61%，收402.83點。今日盤面氣氛偏強，主要由數位雲端、創新板、金融業及電子零組件業等族群帶動。\"}],[],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_tldr__Br5BY\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"b\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_tldrTitle__K5PBN\",\"children\":\"本文重點\"}],[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_tldrList__VSc2_\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"加權與櫃買指數雙雙收紅。\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"數位雲端、金融等族群表現強勢。\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"電子零組件業多檔個股漲幅亮眼。\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"3\",{\"children\":\"外資台指期淨空單水位仍高。\"}]]}]]}],[[\"$\",\"section\",\"sec-1\",{\"id\":\"sec-1\",\"className\":\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\",\"children\":\"一、大盤表現總覽\"}],[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_p__aZlQ1\",\"children\":\"今日台股大盤呈現上漲格局，加權指數收盤上漲0.77%，櫃買指數也同步走高0.61%。整體上市股票中，上漲家數少於下跌家數，但成交金額接近9900億元，顯示市場資金動能仍在。\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_tblScroll__z9kbb\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"table\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_tbl__0yNgv\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"thead\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"tr\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"th\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"項目\"}],[\"$\",\"th\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"收盤指數\"}],[\"$\",\"th\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"漲跌幅\"}],[\"$\",\"th\",\"3\",{\"children\":\"成交金額\"}]]}]}],[\"$\",\"tbody\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"tr\",\"0\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"加權指數\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"46331.45\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"+0.77%\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"3\",{\"children\":\"9895.0 億\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"tr\",\"1\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"櫃買指數\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"402.83\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"+0.61%\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"3\",{\"children\":\"-\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"tr\",\"2\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"上市家數\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"上漲 346 / 下跌 577\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"平均 -0.05%\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"3\",{\"children\":\"-\"}]]}]]}]]}]}]]]}],[\"$\",\"section\",\"sec-2\",{\"id\":\"sec-2\",\"className\":\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\",\"children\":\"二、族群表現概況\"}],[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_p__aZlQ1\",\"children\":\"盤面上，部分族群表現相對強勢，其中數位雲端類股漲幅居冠，創新板股票、金融業及電子零組件業也有不錯的漲勢。同時，也有部分族群呈現下跌，如塑膠工業、航運業等。\"}],[\"$\",\"ul\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_listCheck__xx1CF\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"數位雲端類股上漲3.19%，由8932 智通領漲。\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"創新板股票上漲1.69%，7835 永悅健康-創表現突出。\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"金融業上漲1.59%，6016 康和證領漲。\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"3\",{\"children\":\"電子零組件業上漲1.05%，2492 華新科漲勢顯著。\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"4\",{\"children\":\"塑膠工業下跌1.35%。\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"5\",{\"children\":\"航運業下跌1.31%。\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"6\",{\"children\":\"運動休閒下跌1.15%。\"}]]}]]]}],[\"$\",\"section\",\"sec-3\",{\"id\":\"sec-3\",\"className\":\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\",\"children\":\"三、個股漲跌與市場焦點\"}],[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_p__aZlQ1\",\"children\":\"在個別股票表現方面，今日有數檔個股漲幅達到10%或接近10%，例如電子零組件的華新科。相對地，也有股票出現較大跌幅。此外，部分個股因成交量相對平日放大，顯示市場關注度提升。\"}],[\"$\",\"ol\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_listNum__86N5S\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"上市漲幅榜上，2492 華新科上漲10.00%，成交量52649張。\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"3665 貿聯-KY上漲9.98%，3406 玉晶光上漲9.95%。\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"上市跌幅榜上，2464 盟立下跌9.95%，2321 東訊下跌7.46%。\"}],\"$L18\"]}],\"$L19\"]]}],\"$L1a\",\"$L1b\",\"$L1c\",\"$L1d\",\"$L1e\"],null]}]]}]}]\n18:[\"$\",\"li\",\"3\",{\"children\":\"當沖熱門股中，國喬的量比高達46.6倍，中揚光量比14.1倍，達邁上漲9.90%且量比達7.0倍。\"}]\n19:[\"$\",\"figure\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_fig__uoT7r\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_figFrame__jJ7E4\",\"children\":\"!外資期貨空單水位高!上市下跌家數較多!塑膠航運類股偏弱!國際股市表現分歧\"}],[\"$\",\"figcaption\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_figCap__LnUbb\",\"children\":\"盤面觀察提醒\"}]]}]\n1a:[\"$\",\"section\",\"sec-4\",{\"id\":\"sec-4\",\"className\":\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\",\"children\":\"四、法人動向與籌碼面\"}],[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_p__aZlQ1\",\"children\":\"從法人交易數據來看，外資與自營商在現貨市場皆有買賣超動作。期貨市場方面，外資台指期淨空單口數維持在相對高點，顯示其對後市看法可能較為謹慎。全市場融資維持率則維持在193.3%。\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_tblScroll__z9kbb\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"table\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_tbl__0yNgv\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"thead\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"tr\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"th\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"項目\"}],[\"$\",\"th\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"買賣超張數\"}],[\"$\",\"th\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"台指期未平倉口數\"}]]}]}],[\"$\",\"tbody\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"tr\",\"0\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"外資現貨\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"約 438,966 張\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"tr\",\"1\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"自營商現貨\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"約 375,346 張\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"tr\",\"2\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"外資台指期淨空單\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"83,655 口\"}]]}]]}]]}]}]]]}]\n1b:[\"$\",\"section\",\"sec-5\",{\"id\":\"sec-5\",\"className\":\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\",\"children\":\"五、國際盤與相關消息\"}],[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_p__aZlQ1\",\"children\":\"國際股市方面，美國主要指數如S&P 500、那斯達克及費城半導體指數均呈現上漲。亞洲股市則表現分歧，韓國綜合指數下跌，日經225指數小幅上漲。今日台股相關新聞多聚焦於特定電子股的表現。\"}],[\"$\",\"ul\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_listCheck__xx1CF\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"S&P 500指數上漲0.72%，那斯達克指數上漲1.57%。\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"費城半導體指數上漲2.33%。\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"韓國綜合指數下跌1.79%，日經225指數上漲0.41%。\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"3\",{\"children\":\"今日台股新聞多圍繞2313 華通等電子股的爆量與漲停表現。\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"4\",{\"children\":\"近三日國際消息提及川普對北京強硬言論，以及簽署公告暫停部分牛肉關稅等。\"}]]}]]]}]\n1c:[\"$\",\"section\",\"sec-6\",{\"id\":\"sec-6\",\"className\":\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\",\"children\":\"常見問題 FAQ\"}],[[\"$\",\"div\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_faq__cemBp\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"details\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_faqItem__I9h0U\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"children\":\"今天台股整體表現如何？\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_faqA__IPuvc\",\"children\":\"今日加權指數上漲0.77%，收在46331.45點，櫃買指數也上漲0.61%，整體市場呈現上漲格局。\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_faqItem__I9h0U\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"children\":\"哪些產業類股今天表現比較好？\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_faqA__IPuvc\",\"children\":\"數位雲端類、創新板股票、金融業以及電子零組件業今天表現相對強勢，漲幅較為明顯。\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_faqItem__I9h0U\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"children\":\"法人今天在市場上有什麼動向？\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_faqA__IPuvc\",\"children\":\"外資與自營商在現貨市場皆有買賣超。在期貨市場，外資的台指期淨空單口數仍維持在83,655口。\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"3\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_faqItem__I9h0U\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"children\":\"國際股市對台股有影響嗎？\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_faqA__IPuvc\",\"children\":\"今日美國主要指數如S&P 500、那斯達克和費城半導體指數均上漲，而亞洲股市則表現分歧，韓國下跌、日本上漲。\"}]]}]]}]]]}]\n1d:[\"$\",\"section\",\"sec-7\",{\"id\":\"sec-7\",\"className\":\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\",\"children\":\"總結\"}],[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_p__aZlQ1\",\"children\":\"總結今日盤勢，台股加權指數與櫃買指數雙雙收紅，由數位雲端、金融及電子零組件等族群帶動。儘管上漲家數少於下跌，但市場成交量能充足，顯示資金動能仍在，而外資期貨空單水位則需持續留意。\"}]]]}]\n1e:[\"$\",\"section\",\"sec-8\",{\"id\":\"sec-8\",\"className\":\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\",\"children\":\"延伸閱讀\"}],[[\"$\",\"ul\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_list__WjxqC\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"0\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L17\",\"0-台股學堂\",{\"href\":\"/school\",\"className\":\"LearnArticle_link__gMwHV\",\"children\":\"台股學堂\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"1\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L17\",\"0-台股教學專欄\",{\"href\":\"/learn\",\"className\":\"LearnArticle_link__gMwHV\",\"children\":\"台股教學專欄\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"2\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L17\",\"0-大盤總覽 (會員\",{\"href\":\"/diary\",\"className\":\"LearnArticle_link__gMwHV\",\"children\":\"大盤總覽 (會員)\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"3\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L17\",\"0-今日戰情 (會員\",{\"href\":\"/diary\",\"className\":\"LearnArticle_link__gMwHV\",\"ch